{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_08_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_08",
  "title": "嘉維爾之拳",
  "storyCode": "RI-8",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4d71e8d92b577f013b1ede6944a88e515651b170e371200049f8323ac75b69fe",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！哎，不對，下次我應該換個叫聲，有點膩了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "喂，他沒事吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "不用擔心，等一會兒他就會回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "好吧，不過那真的是普通人嗎？我沒聽說有這樣的啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "不知道，大祭司只說過他在這裡生活了很久很久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "好吧，比起這個......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "呼，真是個了不得的大傢伙啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "嘉維爾，你頭上在流血啊，沒事吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "沒事沒事，這點小傷，特米米，把我的醫療包拿過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "嗯？特米米這丫頭人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "給，你的醫療包。至於特米米，剛才快要贏的時候我好像看到她慌慌張張地往其他地方跑去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "謝了。她不會被嚇破膽了吧，算了，先包紮再說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "對了，你們去看看有沒有受傷的傢伙，全部帶到我這來，我來給他們治療。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "噢，交給我吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哈哈，沒問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "誒，好麻煩啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "別抱怨啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "博士......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "大醜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "祖瑪瑪，抱歉啊，只能把它拆掉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我檢查了一下，你的引擎還能用，我會把它還給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "是嗎，太好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "嘉維爾，你不打算留下來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "嗯，我和你一樣，找到了要做的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "是醫生嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "做醫生很開心嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "造機器很開心嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "開心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "那就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "但是，大酋長依然需要你來做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "哈？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "無論如何，大醜倒下了是事實，你贏了，嘉維爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "看，人群重新聚集了起來，大家都在看著你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "嘖，博士，怎麼辦啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "由你決定。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "這不是跟沒說一樣嗎！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "博士，別裝睡了！我可是醫生！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "大酋長嘉維爾萬歲！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "嘖，博士，我現在真想給你一拳。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嘉維爾，你沒事吧！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嗯？沒事。你跑哪裡去了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "誒？啊，那個，我剛才忽然想上廁所！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "好吧......嗯？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "怎麼了，嘉維爾，你怎麼忽然看著我？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "唔......哈哈，有了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "所有人都聽著！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "我戰勝了大醜，所以接下來由我來擔任大酋長。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "在這裡，我要對你們說的是——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "拳頭，就是一切！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "誒，嘉維爾，你要留下來做大酋長了嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "但是！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "我有非常重要的事要去做，所以我還是要離開。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "不過你們不用擔心！我不在的時候，會由特米米來代替我發號施令！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "把特米米當成是我就行了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "誒、誒誒誒？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "text": "誒，這樣真的行得通嗎？這裡的人不是力量至上什麼的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "但嘉維爾是大酋長，她已經征服了所有人，所以她說的話當然是令人信服的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "哈哈，祖瑪瑪，機器雖然很有意思，但是對我來說，果然還是拳頭更好啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "哼，別忘了，我並沒有承認你，我會造出更厲害的機器，然後再來挑戰你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "好啊，我等著。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "哦對了，在那之前，你得跟我走一趟。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "為什麼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "你必須先跟我去羅德島觀察一下你的礦石病。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我可以拒絕嗎，我還有大醜要......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "這次可由不得你，而且在特米米就任前，我就是大酋長，就算是綁著你我也要帶你去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "好吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "......嘉維爾，你還是要走嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "是啊，等把引擎拆下來裝回飛行器上，我就該走了吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "不行。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "我、我不准你走！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
